# Error Boot Log Dataset

## Overview

This directory contains boot logs collected from controlled fault injection experiments performed on a Raspberry Pi 3B+ platform.

The purpose of this dataset is to generate realistic boot failure scenarios for training and evaluating the AI-based boot log analytics system. Logs are captured across multiple boot stages and used for anomaly detection, failure classification, root-cause analysis, and boot-stage localization.

---

## Test Environment

### Hardware Platform

- Raspberry Pi 3B+
- 32 GB+ microSD Card
- USB-to-TTL UART Adapter
- Host Machine for Log Collection

